  "SUPERSEDED_2026_09_27": {
    "status": "UNVERIFIABLE_INPUT",
    "why": "this analysis reasons entirely from R8's recorded summary statistics - zero fraction, both-positive count, median sampling sd - every one of which is a function of which genes R8's columns actually held. R8 read an unhashed development cache at /tmp/jepa_tour_logexpr.npz which the R8 package explicitly did not include (original_cell_level_data_included false, original_bundle_copied false) and which no longer exists. The materializer lineage that most plausibly produced it - foundation_materialize_discovery_expression.py, sha256 ede646be8030ef16 - carries the same HVS_COMMON/SEA_AD_COMMON positional mapping defect that scrambled the Level-4 gene identities.",
